.TH "libnvmf_params_for_each" 9 "libnvmf_params_for_each" "October 2026" "libnvme API manual" LINUX
.SH NAME
libnvmf_params_for_each \- iterate over set connection parameters.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B "void" libnvmf_params_for_each
.BI "(const struct libnvmf_params *params "  ","
.BI "void (*callback)(const char *key, const char *value, void *user_data) "  ","
.BI "void *user_data "  ");"
.SH ARGUMENTS
.IP "params" 12
a resolved parameter set
.IP "callback" 12
called once per key in first-insertion order; \fIvalue\fP is the
empty string for an explicit reset, never NULL
.IP "user_data" 12
caller context passed to \fIcallback\fP
